  "surface": "design",
  "title": "包豪斯几何",
  "description": "包豪斯现代主义幻灯片模版：暖白底上圆/方/三角三原色几何作为版面结构主角，小写几何无衬线标题、粗黑规则线、45° 旋转元素、零装饰大留白。适合设计语言发布、品牌升级提案、设计评审与方法论宣讲。",
  "cover": "cover.png",
  "entry": "entry.html",
  "source": {
    "name": "slide-maker",
    "repository": "https://github.com/addsumtech/slides_maker",
    "license": "MIT",
    "attribution": "Ported from the slide-maker skill 'bauhaus' preset to an iPolloWork HTML slides template."
  },
